api/README.md
# Legibility Office API

## Purpose

The Legibility Office API provides programmatic access to the Institutional Operating System (IOS).

The API enables governments, researchers, development finance institutions, and technology partners to integrate institutional intelligence into their own systems.

---

# Core Services

- Governance Intelligence
- Procurement Intelligence
- Institutional Capability
- Digital Public Infrastructure
- AI Governance
- Institutional Memory
- Institutional Signals
- Knowledge Graph

---

# Base URL

```
https://api.legibilityoffice.org/v1/
```

---

# Authentication

API Key

OAuth 2.0 (future)

---

# Response Format

JSON

